{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS."}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/gettingstarted"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","text":"Create a new iOS project"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File > New > Project…"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org"},{"type":"text","text":" and on the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},{"type":"text","text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"],"syntax":null},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" repository."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import MapLibre"]},{"text":"SwiftUI","anchor":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" style:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"UIKit","anchor":"UIKit","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use the following ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController"},{"text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(mapView)","","        mapView.delegate = self","    }","","    \/\/ MLNMapViewDelegate method called when map has finished loading","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading _: MLNStyle) {","    }","}"]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-native-distribution":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"maplibre-gl-native-distributon","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"maplibre-gl-native-distributon","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},"https://swiftpackageindex.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-native-distribution":{"url":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package Index","type":"text"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","title":"Swift Package Index"},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","titleInlineContent":[{"ty